{"repositoryId":411630635,"availability":"available","full":"terramate-io/terramate","name":"terramate","description":"Open-source Infrastructure as Code (IaC) orchestration platform: GitOps workflows, orchestration, code generation, observability, drift detection, asset management, policies, Slack notifications, and more. Integrates with Terraform, OpenTofu, Terragrunt, Kubernetes, GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD, BitBucket Pipelines, and any other CI/CD platform.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":3637,"forks":131,"created":"2021-09-29T10:33:53Z","updated":"2026-10-14T12:10:23Z","license":"MPL-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://terramate.io","topics":[],"demo":"https://play.terramate.io/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:59.887Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:59.887Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:59.887Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T17:00:59.887Z","stars":3637,"forks":131}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["🚀 Getting Started | 📖 Documentation | 💻 Playground | 🙌 Join Us","Terramate CLI is an open-source orchestration and code generation engine that allows Infrastructure as Code (IaC) such as Terraform, OpenTofu, Terragrunt and Kubernetes to scale.","Terramate CLI can optionally be paired with Terramate Cloud, a fully managed SaaS service that adds additional features to manage and observe all your infrastructure managed with IaC in one or multiple repositories."],"features":["Break up large, monolithic state files into multiple smaller stacks to limit blast radius, reduce runtimes and unlock better collaboration.","Reduce code duplication by programmatically generating native Terraform backend and provider configurations or any other arbitrary files using the Terramate compiler.","Using a graph-based orchestration engine, orchestrate any command such as terraform apply in stacks. Only deploy stacks that contain changes using change detection built on top 